Package: dosfstools
Architecture: any
Depends:
 ${misc:Depends},
 ${shlibs:Depends},
Description: utilities for making and checking MS-DOS FAT filesystems
 The dosfstools package includes the mkfs.fat and fsck.fat utilities, which
 respectively make and check MS-DOS FAT filesystems.

